  data:
    title: Business Wrapper Variants
    summary: BusinessWrapper copies balancing from an underlying business while keeping
      separate identity and references.
    resourcePrefix: demo_wrappers
    sections:
    - heading: Project setup
      body: Create a BusinessWrapper and assign underlyingBusiness. The wrapper copies
        and remaps its source automatically when it is enabled or validated; no extra
        sync component or demo action is required. Use wrapper metadata and scale fields
        for intentional differences.
